<h3>Hello!</h3>

<p>
    I am Michael L. 'Greyrib' Abildgaard and this is the current iteration of my GH-hosted Blazor-based portfolio, using some of the stuff I have experience with.
</p>

<p>
    I do software development, currently primarily in C#, touching on other languages and new techs and what-not, when I get the opportunity.
</p>

<h4>Current Projects</h4>
<ul>
    <li>A Unity-made, SPAZ-inspired game for release on Steam, where I currently have a developer account and am currently testing multiplayer functionality.</li>
    <li>A music player app for Android & iOS, with two-way Bluetooth interaction, Spotify-integration, local playlist management, tagging, high level of configuration & a 'semi-soundboard' for use with local files.</li>
</ul>

